# missingmed — Missing-data causal mediation (R package, mediationverse)
# Scope decided 2026-06-04 (Data-Wise/missingmed#1): general CRAN-targeted toolkit —
# MI + IPW estimators, SEM + GLM models, MAR + MNAR sensitivity. S7-first.
# Thin orchestration layer: fit via medfit, infer via rmediation, simulate via medsim.

## Quick Notes
- Scope spec + 6-phase roadmap: docs/specs/SPEC-missingmed-scope-2026-06-04.md (on dev)
- Contracts confirmed: rmediation (MBCO/MC-CI, consumes medfit MediationData),
  medfit (fit_mediation/extract_mediation -> MediationData@estimates/@vcov).
- missingmed's unique code = Rubin's-rules pooling of NAMED (estimates, vcov) + IPW weights + MNAR.
- Next: Phase 0 S7 migration (integration key — enables medfit/rmediation interop). Critical path.
- Branches: main (protected) <- dev (current) <- feature/*. Companion manuscript: research/Missing Effect.
